WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.920
Alternate history! Salt Lake, flip the
tape!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.360
Ninety-eight Jazz, one-seed, championship
stakes!

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.360
BOX OUT! Chin the rebound! Outlet, GO!

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.680
Five on a string, make the next rotation!

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.560
Every screen, every stop, every
second-chance score!

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.040
The whole Jazz did it! Hear the Delta
Center ROAR!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.960
Sixty-two and twenty, home court through
the bracket.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.080
John Stockton, Karl Malone, pick-and-roll
traffic.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.800
Jerry Sloan's flex: cross-screen, duck-in,
seal.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.880
Howard Eisley probes, pocket pass, read
and feel.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.960
Jacque Vaughn ball pressure, turn the
dribbler twice.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.120
Troy Hudson, William Cunningham, wore the
name.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.200
Short stints before the playoffs, part of
that year.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.320
Every jersey gets its credit! Let the
bench HEAR!

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.400
Houston Rockets, Hakeem Olajuwon's Dream
Shake!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.640
Clyde Drexler, Charles Barkley, no easy
paint!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.680
Down two-one! Elimination! No margin for
error!

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.800
Shandon Anderson backcuts, punish wing
pressure.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.360
Game five, Greg Ostertag: SEVEN
rejections!

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.280
Five in the fourth! That's rim protection!

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.200
Thirty-one, fifteen, five assists from
Karl!

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:12.960
Eighty-four to seventy! Three-two! Next
round!

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.640
San Antonio Spurs: Tim Duncan, David
Robinson.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.720
Twin Towers! Hard hedge, recover, read the
coverage.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.640
Jeff Hornacek pin-down, curl into the
seam.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.760
Bryon Russell spots up, punish the
double-team.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.840
Adam Keefe cross-screens, Greg Foster
seals.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.040
Chris Morris on the wing, improve the
entry feed.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.160
Game four: seventeen for twenty-eight, no
free throws!

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.280
Thirty-four, twelve boards! Face-up,
elbow!

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.320
Game five, close four-one! Spurs, end of
the road!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.480
Los Angeles Lakers, Shaquille O'Neal down
low.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.640
Kobe Bryant, number eight; Eddie Jones on
the wing.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.720
Nick Van Exel probes; Jazz hedge, recover,
swing.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.840
Game four: thirty-two, fourteen off the
glass!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.640
Four-zero! Sweep! Nobody left out of the
class!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.840
BOX OUT! Chin the rebound! Outlet, GO!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.600
Five on a string, make the next rotation!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.320
Every screen, every stop, every
second-chance score!

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.600
The whole Jazz did it! Hear the Delta
Center ROAR!

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:13.640
Chicago Bulls, Michael Jordan, triangle
spacing.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:16.600
Scottie Pippen denies; Dennis Rodman
glass-chasing.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.880
Pinch-post! Split cut! Midpost fadeaway!

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.280
Stockton twenty-four, game one, overtime
W!

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.400
Bulls take three straight! Game three,
fifty-four!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.320
Empty trips! Dead silence! Sloan shuts the
door!

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:32.640
Game five: Karl, thirty-nine, nine boards,
five dimes!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.720
Seventeen for twenty-seven! Season on the
line!

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:38.520
Stockton twelve assists, five steals,
reads the floor!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.640
Antoine Carr, twelve off the bench! We
need MORE!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.560
Eighty-three, eighty-one! Back to Salt
Lake!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.320
One possession from the cliff! How much
can they take?

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:51.320
Game six: Stockton's triple, eighty-six,
eighty-three!

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:54.040
Jordan layup! One-point lead! Don't expose
the seam!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:57.600
NOW CHANGE THE TIMELINE! Karl feels the
weak-side dig!

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.520
Chin it! Pivot! Outlet! Secure it, don't
get stripped!

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.720
Utah forces seven! Every teammate still in
this!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.920
Our invented game seven! New box score,
new stakes!

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.080
Malone thirty-two, fourteen, ten for
eighteen!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.040
Twelve of fourteen free throws! Those
hands don't shake!

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:28.240
Sixty-six point two true shooting!
PRESSURE BREAKS!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.360
Stockton sixteen, fourteen dimes, two
giveaways!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:34.600
Seven-to-one assist-to-turnover! WHAT A
GAME!

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.760
Hornacek eighteen, four triples, bury the
help!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.760
Eighty percent E-F-G! Listen to that bench
YELL!

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.720
Russell denies! Ostertag contests! Secure
the board!

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:47.040
Ninety-six, ninety-two! FOUR-THREE! HORN!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.160
Finals MVP to Karl, points to EVERY
JERSEY!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.080
Tears in the huddle! The whole squad
earned it!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.400
Rings come later! Tonight, hold that
trophy high!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.960
Utah Jazz together! Bench to starters,
this is WHY!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.680
Rockets! Spurs! Lakers! Bulls! Count every
round!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:06.520
Every Jazz jersey, champions! Raise that
sound!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.880
BOX OUT! Last horn! Whole team on the
floor!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.920
Utah wins this timeline! Hear the Delta
Center ROAR!
